::BeforeSupplyChainCh9
@trigger 
@when       IsSolutionFoundFor(Research), IsSolutionFoundFor(Design)
@cutscene 
@once 

//incoming call
{@Ovill}    Locke! Have you heard? The... Boron... ppp... PIRATES are ...

//incoming call - interruption of current call
{@Callie}   Pirates? Oh, how terrifying.
{@Ovill}    What?! Who is this?
{@Callie}   Why, it is I...
{@Player}   Here we go...
{@Callie}   Callie Lee! The Space Pirate Queen of Velos Station!
{@Player}   Hey, Callie. Or should I call you Cordelia?
{@Callie}	Cordelia is long gone. I'm Callie now.
{@Ovill}    This isn't funny! They're charging tolls on every shipment that crosses their territory!
{@Ovill}    That's you too, Locke!
{@Callie}   Sounds like a toll to me.
{@Ovill}    It's extortion!
{@Callie}   When Frontier does it, they call it a service fee.

//end call


::AfterFabrication 
@trigger    OnOverarchingLoaded
@when       IsSolutionFoundFor(Design), IsSolutionFoundFor(Research), IsSolutionFoundFor(Supply), IsSolutionFoundFor(Fabrication)
@cutscene
@once

{@MAL}      Time to submiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiii-
{@MAL}      Hi CaptiAin, howwww are you doing today?
{@Player}   ...
{@Player}   Keela's hack is complicating things.
{@Player}   P... M.A.L., after this contract, we need to make a detour. 
